{
    "FileVersion": 3,
    "EngineAssociation": "5.7",
    "Category": "Development",
    "Description": "Test host: RLtools SAC (OnlineSACRuntime) behind Schola's UAdaptiveNPCPolicy. Schola is the repository root, reached through the Plugins/Schola junction made by Prepare-AdaptiveSAC.ps1.",
